{"title":"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A right circular cone of volume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, a right circular cylinder of volume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" />, and a sphere of volume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> all have the same radius, and the common height of the cone and the cylinder is equal to the diameter of the sphere. Then\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/1/10112d0a9aef9a1703c98896b3beb42824c0c31c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } A-M+C = 0 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } A+M=C \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 2A = M+C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"489\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/5/835d56f3e41d627eef65e47d434f2a17fb951369.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }A^2 - M^2 + C^2 = 0 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 2A + 2M = 3C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"400\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> the three volumes can be computed as follows:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/2/c026982e683d90def991314dbadd75f14ff8209d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = \\frac 13 (\\pi r^2) \\cdot 2r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"122\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/c/e5cd8032544cd02e4c4b4c3601ce57683ab313c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M = (\\pi r^2) \\cdot 2r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/f/19fcfa34f7517321587d4032d0f22a13167bb572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C = \\frac 43 \\pi r^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"77\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Clearly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/9/8c95b07721b246c4ba28075071bb9dcff8f1d636.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M = A+C \\Longrightarrow$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"127\" height=\"14\" /> the correct answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/2/ca2f4283cfd441270cb90bfd2cf89a533f3dde81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>The other linear combinations are obviously non-zero, and the left hand side of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/b/bfbf4df7c25681bb178ddc50ee0c0d656aa25b5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" /> evaluates to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7def8f9e8f739900b267f516bd82c4ffea25e9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\pi r^3)^2 \\cdot \\left( \\frac 49 - 4 + \\frac {16}9 \\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"173\" height=\"43\" /> which is negative. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/2/ca2f4283cfd441270cb90bfd2cf89a533f3dde81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" /> is indeed the only correct answer.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME\" title=\"1998 AHSME\">1998 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1998\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div s